f. mediation; and
g. repatriation and social reintegration.
(3) The provision of integrated services as referred to in paragraph (2) shall be implemented in accordance with SPM.

CHAPTER IX
GUIDANCE AND SUPERVISION
Article 14
(1) The Regent conducts guidance and supervision of the implementation of UPTD PPA. (2) Guidance as referred to in paragraph (1) includes:
a. guidelines and fulfillment standards;
b. technical guidance and training;
c. supervision;
d. provision of facilities;
e. monitoring; and
f. evaluation.
(3) Guidance as referred to in paragraph (2) is in order to realize the objective of protection for women and children victims of violence in accordance with minimum service standards.

